  raceName: Undead
  raceNames:
  - Bones
  - Rattler
  - Archivald
  - Alucard
  - Frank
  hagDif: 50
  rewards:
  - Explore reward
  - survival percentage
  dialogueIntro:
  - We are 1, summoned 2 of a powerful eldritch master. We've been drawn to this
    shack to gather a 3... Does thou perhaps owneth one?
  - Greetings flesh, they named us 1, 2. Our master commanded us to gather a 3 from
    the local traders, canst thou help us?
  dialogueAccept:
  - '*Silently peers into the distance*'
  - Good, good... We will awaiteth for the goods in the corner of thou tomb.
  dialogueRefuse:
  - Master will certainly not be pleaseth with this... Watch your back flesh, for
    it might not survive very long...
  - Oh not again... Master is going to send us back to the abyss again, farewell
    flesh.
  dialogueReturn:
  - Shivering bones have returned for the 3...
  - A
  dialogueComplete:
  - 'Aaaahh yes. Master will certainly be pleased by our work, you''ve earneth your
    coin flesh, take them for they have no value to us anyway. '
  - Fine work flesh, and without even losing a finger. We will taketh this straight
    to our master without delaying any further.
